  "published": "2026-06-09T16:01:52.297Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.10: WebSeedServer now clamps over-EOF Range request ends per RFC 7233 (via SpawnDev.WebTorrent.HttpByteRange) instead of honoring the last-byte-pos verbatim. A range past EOF used to over-promise Content-Length and stream a short body, which a browser fetch rejected as net::ERR_CONTENT_LENGTH_MISMATCH (the web-seed piece never verified). Also returns 416 for a start at/after EOF and fixes a >2GB int length overflow. Requires SpawnDev.WebTorrent 3.2.10.",
